+## Creating JSON Patch diffs
+
+`createPatch(from, to)` returns an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)
+that transforms `from` into `to` without changing either input. It recursively compares object
+members and identifies unchanged array prefixes and suffixes, so unchanged portions are omitted
+from the patch. Changed values are represented with `replace`, while added and removed object
+members use `add` and `remove`. Both inputs must be valid JSON values.
